OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome early brightness possible
OL,6,Facross Shetland. Otherwise a cloudy
OL,7,Fday with some showery rain across
OL,8,FOrkney in the morning, spreading to
OL,9,FShetland later in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers soon dying out
OL,12,Facross Shetland, otherwise a dry
OL,13,Fevening. Thickening cloud will bring
OL,14,Fsome light and patchy rain from the
OL,15,Fsouthwest during the early hours.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FPersistent rain will spread
OL,18,Feast for a time in the morning. Drier
OL,19,Fand brighter weather extending from
OL,20,Fthe west in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
