OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith bright spells on Wednesday. Rain
OL,7,Fspreading northeast Thursday. Windy
OL,8,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain
OL,9,Fon Friday.
